 "result": "**Decorator:** `needs_app_scope` in `src/tessel/cli.py:380`. It wraps the callback so it runs inside the app context, and it loads the app first if none is active.\n\n- You don't need it for commands registered with `@app.cli.command()` or `@bundle.cli.command()`. `AppGroup.command` (`src/tessel/cli.py:405`) applies it automatically. `app.cli` is created at `src/tessel/app.py:338` and `bundle.cli` at `src/tessel/bundles.py:49`.\n- Pass `needs_app_scope=False` to opt out.\n\n**App loader:** `LaunchInfo` in `src/tessel/cli.py:293`. Its `load_app()` method (line 333) finds and loads the app. `needs_app_scope` calls it via `ctx.ensure_object(LaunchInfo).load_app()` (line 397).\n\n`TesselGroup` (`src/tessel/cli.py:531`) is the top-level CLI group and also uses `load_app` to discover commands.",
